  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Desarrollo Universidad de Indias Occidentales</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">University of West Indies Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROJECT WILL ENHANCE UWI&apos;S CAPACITY TO RESPOND TO REGION&apos;S NEEDS IN SCIENCE  TECHNOLOGY AND WILL HAVE 4 SUB-PROGRAMS, ONE FOR EACH CAMPUS AT MONA, JAMAICA; CAVE HILL, BARBADOS; AND ST. AUGUSTINE, TRINIDAD AND ONE FOR THE UNIVERSITY CENTRE, WHICH WOULD IMPLEMENT ACTIONS AND INVESTMENTS PERTAINING TO UWI AS A WHOLE AND THOSE SERVING ENTIRE REGION.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
